# Everything this plugin ships is text an agent reads: Markdown skill documents, JSON manifests,
# and (soon) a Python script. Pin the checkout to LF on every platform.
#
# Git for Windows sets core.autocrlf=true in its system configuration, so without this file a
# Windows clone rewrites every LF as CRLF. That breaks two things quietly: a strict frontmatter
# parser looks for "^---\n" and does not find it, and a script written to disk stops matching the
# bytes it was committed as. `.github/scripts/verify_portability.py` fails on any tracked file that
# carries CRLF, which is what keeps this file honest.
* text=auto eol=lf
